@dev Record a deposit made by a lender (called by authorized vaults)
@param lender Address of the lender
@param amount Amount deposited
@param shares Vault shares received

@dev Record a withdrawal made by a lender (called by authorized vaults)
@param lender Address of the lender
@param amount Amount withdrawn
@param shares Vault shares burned

@dev Get lender profile information
@param lender Address of the lender
@return profile Complete lender profile

@dev Get lender's deposits in a specific vault
@param lender Address of the lender
@param vault Address of the vault
@return totalDeposits Total amount deposited in the vault
@return shares Current shares owned in the vault

@dev Get all vaults where a lender has deposits
@param lender Address of the lender
@return vaults Array of vault addresses with deposits
@return amounts Array of deposit amounts in each vault

@dev Check if a lender is registered and active
@param lender Address to check
@return isRegistered True if lender is registered
@return isActive True if lender is active

@title Lender
@dev Registers lenders and tracks deposits across vaults
Manages lender profiles and deposit history across multiple stablecoin vaults
